getting o/p:movies:null

concepts I learned: Only after rendering does this happen:

useEffect runs

API request starts

Network responds

dispatch happens

Redux state changes

React re-renders

So the first render is not a bug. It is the only possible behavior.Rendering is synchronous and immediate

Effects (useEffect) run after render

Async work always finishes later

Redux just reflects that reality.

Think of it like this:

Render = “What do we know right now?”

Effect = “Go find out more”

